    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_a8a7cf3b",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two women walking and smiling while conversing in an urban setting. One woman is holding a drink, and the text overlay reads, 'i am full! that pho was good!'. The scene is lighthearted and positive, conveying a sense of satisfaction and enjoyment after eating. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging present. The meme's intent is to humorously express fullness and praise for a meal, likely pho, in a relatable and casual way. The visual of happy, casually dressed women enjoying a meal aligns with the text to create a humorous, everyday moment. No protected characteristics are targeted, and no stereotypes or harmful tropes are present. The meme is purely for entertainment and relatability, not to attack or demean any group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_319fc75a"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
