      "label": "two women walking and talking while enjoying a meal",
      "description": "The scene depicts two women walking together in an urban outdoor setting, smiling and engaged in conversation. One woman is holding a drink, and the text overlay indicates they are discussing how full they are after eating pho. The spatial arrangement shows them side-by-side, moving forward, with the background blurred to emphasize their interaction. The scene conveys a lighthearted, positive, and relatable moment of satisfaction after eating.",
