      "instance_name": "street_food_culture",
      "label": "Urban street food culture",
      "description": "The image depicts two women walking in an urban setting, casually enjoying a meal. The text implies they are discussing a recent meal, likely eaten at a street food stall or casual eatery. Background knowledge of street food culture — particularly in Asian cities — helps understand the context of the scene: the casual, social, and often affordable nature of eating out in public spaces, which is common in many urban environments, especially in Asia.",
